{
  "title": "ENI · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2 등 VPC 리소스가 네트워크에 연결하는 가상 인터페이스입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#guide-1\">인터페이스에 연결되는 설정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#guide-2\">직접 관리하는 인터페이스와 서비스용 인터페이스</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>24 / 62</span></div><h1>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>ENI는 <strong>VPC 리소스에 연결하는 가상 네트워크 인터페이스</strong>입니다. 물리 서버의 네트워크 카드처럼 IP 주소와 보안 설정을 가지고 네트워크 통신에 참여합니다.</p><p>EC2를 생성하면 기본 네트워크 인터페이스가 함께 연결됩니다. 필요하면 추가 인터페이스로 관리용 통신과 서비스용 통신을 나눌 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"primary-network-interface\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"secondary-network-interface\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"private-and-public-ip-addresses\"></span><h2>인터페이스에 연결되는 설정</h2><p>ENI는 특정 서브넷과 AZ에 속하며, 사설 IP 주소와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">보안 그룹</a> 등을 가집니다. 인터페이스에 적용한 보안 그룹으로 들어오고 나가는 연결을 제어합니다.</p><p>보조 ENI를 다른 인스턴스로 옮기는 구성을 사용하면 인터페이스의 사설 주소와 관련 설정을 함께 유지할 수 있습니다. 연결 가능한 AZ와 인스턴스별 인터페이스 수를 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"security-group-and-mac-address\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"source-destination-check\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"requester-managed-network-interface\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"prefix-delegation-and-efa\"></span><h2>직접 관리하는 인터페이스와 서비스용 인터페이스</h2><p>일부 ENI는 로드 밸런서나 VPC 엔드포인트 같은 AWS 서비스가 생성하고 관리합니다. 이런 인터페이스는 해당 서비스의 설정을 통해 관리합니다.</p><p>인스턴스가 라우터나 NAT처럼 다른 서버의 트래픽을 전달한다면 소스/대상 확인<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 설정을 검토합니다. 일반 애플리케이션 서버는 기본 확인 기능을 유지합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>서버가 네트워크에 연결되는 구성</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>EC2 인스턴스</strong><span>애플리케이션 실행</span></li><li><strong>ENI</strong><span>사설 IP·보안 그룹</span></li><li><strong>서브넷</strong><span>주소 범위와 통신 경로</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">인터페이스는 서버와 서브넷 사이에서 주소와 연결 설정을 제공합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>보안 장비 역할을 하는 EC2에 관리용 ENI와 트래픽 처리용 ENI를 나눠 연결합니다. 각 인터페이스에 필요한 주소와 보안 그룹을 따로 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>소스/대상 확인</strong> — 인스턴스가 보내거나 받는 패킷의 출발지 또는 목적지인지 확인하는 기능입니다. 다른 리소스의 트래픽을 중계하는 인스턴스는 이 확인을 해제해야 할 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-eni.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Elastic network interfaces ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q012\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q018\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q018\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q018</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q018/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company creates an ENI with a private IP address in a private subnet to access an AWS service. Which endpoint type is this?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A transit gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An interface endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 인터페이스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 만든다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q016\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">이전 용어 <b>ELB / ALB / NLB</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">다음 용어 <b>EventBridge</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
